<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Friday's German first division match:</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund 1 (Ricken 23rd), Hamburg 1 (Baeron 79th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 55,000</p>
